    {
      "id": "L-S2E07-C03",
      "title": "Landon explains SimuLandon to Hope.",
      "description": "Landon explains that SimuLandon is a golem made from his subconscious, meant to carry Hope's blood into the portal, while he keeps telling Hope he loves her.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "SimuLandon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Josie",
          "version": "Josie"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "love",
        "comedy"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "We are calling the other one SimuLandon. I used the prism to manifest my subconscious, and then Josie turned him into a golem. Show her."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Oh."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "We're gonna use him as a decoy. We'll let the sphinx take him into the portal."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I don't want to go in the portal. I want to stay here with Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Uh, I think we need to talk to your subconscious about personal space."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I didn't realize he'd be so vocal. And fast. He ran away after we created him. I guess to find you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "action": "smiles"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "smiles"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Simu-me will disintegrate."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "What? Uh, no one told me that part!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "How does that close the portal?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "That's where you come in."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "My blood's not enough to keep the portal closed. I have to activate my vampire side. Malivore is just gonna spit him out and create a new portal."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Not if he disintegrates before there's anything to spit out. Portal closed, no new portal opens. Both problems solved. Life goes back to normal... ish."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I love you, Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Please stop saying that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I can't help it. I want to shout it from the rooftops. I love Hope..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Ad somnum."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C03-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "hiding smile"
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
