    {
      "id": "L-S2E07-C04",
      "title": "Hope asks Landon to tell her how he feels.",
      "description": "While preparing SimuLandon, Hope confronts Landon for avoiding her. He says it is about doing the right thing, not about what he feels, and it is SimuLandon who answers for him.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "SimuLandon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "love",
        "angst"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Ready?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "So we're not gonna talk about how you walked away from me after we took down the Croatoan?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I didn't have much to say. Welcome back?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Hm. He has plenty to say."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "He is my subconscious. He has no filter. I am a complex, evolved being last time I checked."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Evolved people talk to one other. They don't just stalk off when things get complicated. So why don't you stop avoiding me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I'm not avoiding you. We're literally in the same room."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Oh, you know what I mean. Tell me how you feel."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "It's not about what I feel. It's about doing the right thing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "There's a shelf life on doing the right thing. If you wait too long, it's just wrong."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "So you don't have anything else you want to say to me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I love you. So much."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "smiles"
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Oh, you know what I mean. Tell me how you feel."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "It's not about what I feel. It's about doing the right thing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "There's a shelf life on doing the right thing. If you wait too long, it's just wrong."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "So you don't have anything else you want to say to me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C04-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I love you. So much."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L-S2E07-C05",
      "title": "SimuLandon tells Hope what Landon is afraid to say.",
      "description": "While Hope draws her blood for him, SimuLandon asks why she is leaving town. He tells her she belongs at the school and that Landon is too much of a coward to say he wants her to stay.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "SimuLandon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "love",
        "sacrifice",
        "protect",
        "comfort"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I didn't know I was so afraid of needles. I guess I'll have to add that to the list. Small spaces, um, bugs with wings, doors on hinges... Sorry. Am I talking too mu... I just get... I get chatty when I'm nervous."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Why don't we just sit and wait? Okay? In silence?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Okay."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "So, why you leaving town?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You afraid of the quiet, too?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I'm dead soon. What's the harm in talking?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I don't want to stay because I... I don't want to be where I'm not welcome."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "But you belong here. It's a school for vampires, witches and werewolves. You're all three."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, I know. On paper it makes sense, but in reality, it... it's complicated."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "What's so complicated? Your friends don't want you to have to go into the portal, so they created me to die."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Don't say that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "It's okay. It's true. It's scary as hell, but I'm gonna do whatever it takes to keep you safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You really do say whatever's on your mind."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "It must be the subconscious prism thing. I'm sorry Landon doesn't. I'm not afraid to admit that I'm a coward, but he is. That's why he can't say he wants you to stay. That's why he's not here right now sharing how he feels about you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Can we hold hands before Lizzie comes to take me away?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "kind smile"
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "What's so complicated? Your friends don't want you to have to go into the portal, so they created me to die."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Don't say that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "It's okay. It's true. It's scary as hell, but I'm gonna do whatever it takes to keep you safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You really do say whatever's on your mind."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "It must be the subconscious prism thing. I'm sorry Landon doesn't. I'm not afraid to admit that I'm a coward, but he is. That's why he can't say he wants you to stay. That's why he's not here right now sharing how he feels about you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Can we hold hands before Lizzie comes to take me away?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C05-T16",
