    {
      "id": "L-S2E07-C06",
      "title": "SimuLandon sacrifices himself to save Hope from Clarke.",
      "description": "Clarke corners a weakened Hope to take over her body with the trident. SimuLandon comes to her rescue, fights him and offers himself in her place.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "SimuLandon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Clarke",
          "version": "Clarke"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "sacrifice",
        "protect",
        "love"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Nowhere to go, no one to help you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Hello, brother."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "action": "punches Clarke"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I heard you scream. Are you hurt?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Better now that you're here."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "You should have jumped into the pit instead of your little girlfriend. Are you guys back together? The relationship drama... it's so hard to keep up with sometimes."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "So tired of hearing your voice."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Don't worry. You won't have to hear it much longer. I just don't get it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Oh. Get what?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "What our father sees in you. Sure, you can regenerate, but you have no magic. Someone always has to swoop in and save you. You're pathetic."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I don't care what you or our father think of me. I only care about her."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Sorry, Hope. This is family business."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Okay, I'm impressed."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Don't be. He'll always be the inferior son."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Well, it doesn't look like it from this angle."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Just do it. You don't need her. You need me. Do it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Landon, no!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "This is for you, Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "No!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T20",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Not what I planned, but at least phoenixes are immortal."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T21",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Now you die tomorrow. Boom. I rule."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T22",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Oh, come on. Well this just took a turn."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T23",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "breaks the chains"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T24",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "You're gonna whammy me, aren't you?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T25",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I am."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T26",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Remember that I'm already dealing with the trauma of knowing I'm dying."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T27",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I will."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T28",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Kind of makes the whole sacrifice a little less romantic, though, no? I mean, where is the real deal? He must be off with his other girlfr..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T29",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "knocks off Clarke"
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "I don't care what you or our father think of me. I only care about her."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "Just do it. You don't need her. You need me. Do it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Landon, no!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "SimuLandon"
            },
            "text": "This is for you, Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C06-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "No!"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L-S2E07-C07",
      "title": "Landon's goodbye letter.",
      "description": "Landon leaves Mystic Falls with Rafael and explains why in a letter to Hope and Josie: the monsters will follow him, and he is at the center of all the heartache.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "letter",
      "tags": [
        "letter",
        "goodbye",
        "sacrifice",
        "angst",
        "protect"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I learned today that, no matter how hard we try, we can't solve the monster problem. I'm sorry to do this. I really wanted to avoid this pain, but it's been long enough."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "And sometimes pain is unavoidable."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I've come to the realization that monsters aren't the only problem. I'm the problem, too. I am at the center of all this heartache."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "So I have to leave Mystic Falls, knowing that they'll follow me. I have to let you live your lives without monsters and without me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I hope you can forgive me for this someday, but I understand if you don't. With love and regret, Landon."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "cries"
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I've come to the realization that monsters aren't the only problem. I'm the problem, too. I am at the center of all this heartache."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "So I have to leave Mystic Falls, knowing that they'll follow me. I have to let you live your lives without monsters and without me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E07-C07-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I hope you can forgive me for this someday, but I understand if you don't. With love and regret, Landon."
